  "about": "I am a 3rd year architecture student passionate about creating meaningful spaces that respond to people, culture, and the environment. Through academic projects and design explorations, I focus on human-centered architecture, contextual understanding, and sustainable design approaches. My design process combines research, conceptual thinking, digital modeling, and architectural representation to transform ideas into functional and engaging spaces. I have developed skills in architectural visualization, 3D modeling, and technical documentation using Revit, SketchUp, Illustrator and D5 Render. I am eager to learn from professional practice and contribute creative and thoughtful design solutions to real world challenges.",
